<title>UK: Bank Leu sets warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>Bank Leu sets warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Leu AG said it has issued 15 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Nestle SA.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,900 CHF		 PREMIUM	10.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.44 CHF		  GEARING	12.80 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 19.JUN.97-14.OCT.98   PAYDATE	18.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,853 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
